<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>StringsTable</key>
	<string>Root</string>
	<key>PreferenceSpecifiers</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>画面 · Display</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>先选画质模式，场景细节和帧率再按需调整。重启游戏后生效 · choose a picture mode first; scene detail and frame rate are separate. Takes effect after relaunching</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_IOS_PICTURE_MODE</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>画质模式 · Picture mode</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>mfx</string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>mfx</string>
				<string>native</string>
				<string>1080</string>
				<string>720</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>MetalFX 2K（推荐）· MetalFX 2K</string>
				<string>原生 2K（最清晰，最热）· Native 2K</string>
				<string>1080p（更凉）· 1080p</string>
				<string>720p（最省电）· 720p</string>
			</array>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>MetalFX 2K：1080p 画布 + 输出放大到面板，文字比 1080p 清楚，60 帧稳定；原生 2K：2420x1668 画布，文字真正原生，3D 仍按场景细节渲染，发热更高。原生 2K 需要构建为这块面板烘焙画布（默认构建面向 11 英寸 M5 iPad）；其他面板自动回退到 MetalFX 2K；1080p / 720p 降低显示缓冲，更凉。 · MetalFX 2K: 1080p canvas upscaled to the panel; Native 2K: a 2420x1668 canvas for native text (3D stays at the scene size; hotter). Native 2K needs a build baked for this panel (the default targets the 11-inch M5 iPad); other panels fall back to MetalFX 2K; 1080p / 720p lower the drawable.</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_RENDER_RES</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>场景细节 · Scene detail</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>1600x900</string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>1600x900</string>
				<string>1920x1080</string>
				<string>1280x720</string>
				<string>960x540</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>推荐 1600x900 · Recommended</string>
				<string>清晰 1920x1080（更热）· Sharper</string>
				<string>流畅 1280x720（更凉）· Cooler</string>
				<string>最省电 960x540 · Coolest</string>
			</array>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>只影响 3D 世界，和画质模式独立。1920x1080 比 1600x900 多 44% 像素，发热明显；1280x720 / 960x540 更省电。 · 3D world only, independent of the picture mode. 1920x1080 renders 44% more pixels and runs hotter; 1280x720 / 960x540 are cooler.</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_FPS_CAP</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>帧率 · Frame rate</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>60</string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>60</string>
				<string>120</string>
				<string>30</string>
				<string>interp</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>60 帧（推荐）· 60 fps</string>
				<string>120 帧（最热）· 120 fps</string>
				<string>30 帧（省电）· 30 fps</string>
				<string>60 + 补帧到 120（实验）· 60 interpolated to 120</string>
			</array>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>60 使用真正的 60 Hz 显示节拍，比 120 省电；120 最顺滑也最热；补帧用 MetalFX 插帧到 120，画面更顺但多约一帧延迟，属于实验档。120 和补帧需要 120 Hz 面板，60 Hz 设备自动回退到 60 帧。重启游戏后生效 · 60 uses a real 60 Hz display link and saves power over 120; interpolation adds MetalFX frames up to 120 with about one frame of latency (experimental). 120 and interpolation need a 120 Hz panel; a 60 Hz device falls back to 60. Takes effect after relaunching</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_ASPECT</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>画面比例 · Aspect ratio</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>display</string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>display</string>
				<string>0</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>填满屏幕 · Fill the screen</string>
				<string>16:9 · 黑边 · Letterbox</string>
			</array>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>填满屏幕会把 16:9 画面延伸到 iPad 全屏，少数 UI 特效可能偏移（实验性）· fills the iPad screen; a few UI effects may sit off (experimental)</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_TAA</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>边缘平滑（MetalFX 时间性）· Edge smoothing</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<false/>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>对 3D 画面做时间性抗锯齿，边缘更稳；可能有轻微拖影，默认关闭。重启游戏后生效 · temporal anti-aliasing of the 3D scene; slight ghosting is possible. Off by default; takes effect after relaunching</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>界面 · Interface</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>重启游戏后生效 · takes effect after relaunching</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_HUD_MODE</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>屏幕状态 · On-screen status</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>all</string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>all</string>
				<string>off</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>显示（FPS、MetalFX、分辨率）· Show</string>
				<string>关闭（更沉浸）· Off</string>
			</array>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>开启时右上角显示帧率、MetalFX 状态和分辨率，行尾是待补译的着色器数量；关闭后整行隐藏 · shows FPS, MetalFX and resolution in the top-right, with the number of shaders waiting for translation; off hides the line</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>手柄与键盘 · Controller and keyboard</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_GYRO</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>手柄陀螺仪 · Controller gyroscope</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>需要带陀螺仪的手柄（DualSense / DualShock / Switch Pro）· needs a controller with a gyroscope</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_RUMBLE</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>手柄震动 · Controller rumble</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>需要支持 HD 震动的手柄 · needs a controller with haptics</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_KEYBOARD</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>妙控键盘 · Magic Keyboard</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>auto</string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>auto</string>
				<string>off</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>自动（连接时启用）</string>
				<string>关闭</string>
			</array>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>自动检测硬件键盘；关闭后只用触屏和手柄，防止键盘异常时无法操作 · detects a hardware keyboard; off keeps touch and controllers only</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_TOUCH_WITH_KEYBOARD</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>连接键盘时保留触屏 · Keep touch with a keyboard</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<false/>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>默认像手柄一样收起触控层；打开后键盘和触屏同时可用 · the touch layer hides for a keyboard by default; on keeps both</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>存档 · Save</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_BACKUP</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>iCloud Drive 自动备份 · iCloud Drive backup</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>首次启用时 App 会让你选择一个 iCloud Drive 文件夹；save 和 game-slot 会自动镜像过去，删 App 也不会丢 · the app asks for an iCloud Drive folder once; save and game-slot are mirrored there and survive deleting the app</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>游戏语言 · Game language</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>重新启动游戏后生效 · takes effect after relaunching the game</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_LANG</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>語言 · Language</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string></string>
				<string>zh-Hant</string>
				<string>zh-Hans</string>
				<string>en-US</string>
				<string>ja</string>
				<string>de</string>
				<string>es</string>
				<string>fr</string>
				<string>it</string>
				<string>nl</string>
				<string>ru</string>
				<string>ko</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>自動 · 跟隨系統語言 · Follow system language</string>
				<string>繁體中文</string>
				<string>简体中文</string>
				<string>English</string>
				<string>日本語</string>
				<string>Deutsch</string>
				<string>Español</string>
				<string>Français</string>
				<string>Italiano</string>
				<string>Nederlands</string>
				<string>Русский</string>
				<string>한국어</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
